ial free environment (default: the\n@@ -2242,7 +2242,7 @@\n \n \n (defn lower-task\n-  \"The lower of §7.2 into recv, a fresh semantic-register machine of the\n+  \"The lower of §7.2 into recv, a fresh semantic machine of the\n    receiver's composition: gate to frames (decode) and the store keys,\n    then pendings and install records, dependency closure (code, closures,\n    primitives), each step over the whole tree before the next, then\ndiff --git a/test/yin/vm/debruijn/stack_parity_test.cljc b/test/yin/vm/debruijn/stack_parity_test.cljc\nindex 7459e8e6..22536e7e 100644\n--- a/test/yin/vm/debruijn/stack_parity_test.cljc\n+++ b/test/yin/vm/debruijn/stack_parity_test.cljc\n@@ -3,7 +3,7 @@\n    integration'): the two executable pipelines compared end to end.\n \n      A: sr-linearize/project -> derive/stack-image -> yin.vm.debruijn.stack\n-     B: ast->datoms -> semantic-register/load-ast\n+     B: ast->datoms -> semantic/load-ast\n \n    Execution fixtures are the actual corpora, reused rather than copied:\n    `yin.vm.parity-test/corpus` and `yin.vm-test/semantic-bytecode-corpus`\n@@ -117,7 +117,7 @@\n \n \n (defn- named-outcome\n-  \"Pipeline B: AST datoms onto a fresh semantic-register VM.\"\n+  \"Pipeline B: AST datoms onto a fresh semantic VM.\"\n   [ast]\n   (outcome #(vm/run (load-ast (semantic/create-vm\n                                 {:make-stream tu/make-stream,\ndiff --git a/test/yin/vm/ucf/holder/export_test.cljc b/test/yin/vm/ucf/holder/export_test.cljc\nindex 85e76735..2bca8a65 100644\n--- a/test/yin/vm/ucf/holder/export_test.cljc\n+++ b/test/yin/vm/ucf/holder/export_test.cljc\n@@ -2,7 +2,7 @@\n   \"D8 over the row carrier (UCF 7.7.4; r3 1.8 and 1.9; phase 7b): the\n    exporting state, the prepare/encode split over rows/lift-task, the\n    export-recovery object version 2, its fenced rehydration and the abort\n-   rule. Every machine is a semantic-register machine the real engine\n+   rule. Every machine is a semantic machine the real engine\n   